  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Members of the dairy cooperative Cooperativa Ciervo Cu (Ciervo Cu) will work with Alter Vida (PY- 209) to develop a more reliable food supply and increase their income by improving their production and their organization. The project should benefit 500 families in the community of Ciervo Cu-San Francisco directly and another 1,500 residents indirectly.</narrative>
